<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Wednesday that D.R. Horton Inc and Mercury Finance Co were not available for after-hours trading.</p>
<p>Mercury said earlier in the day that it had discovered some accounting irregularities that caused an overstatement of some previously released earnings.</p>
<p>Horton said it had signed a definitive agreement to buy the Torrey Group of Companies.</p>
<p>The exchange said Corimon SACA, Westmoreland Coal Co and Westmoreland preferred A stock were also not available.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
